    ~ Not n0 gives true, and gives false, or gives false, ternary gives b.

    ~ When n0 skips.

    ~ If n1 is truthy.

    ~ Not n1 gives false, and gives true, or gives true, ternary gives a.

    ~ When n1 plays.

    ~ If nm2 is truthy.

    ~ Not nm2 gives false, and gives true, or gives true, ternary gives a.

    ~ When nm2 plays.

    ~ If h is truthy.

    ~ Not h gives false, and gives true, or gives true, ternary gives a.

    ~ When h plays.

    ~ If s0 is truthy.

    ~ Not s0 gives false, and gives true, or gives true, ternary gives a.

    ~ When s0 plays.

    ~ If sempty is falsy.

    ~ Not sempty gives true, and gives false, or gives false, ternary gives b.

    ~ When sempty skips.

    ~ If sspace is truthy.

    ~ Not sspace gives false, and gives true, or gives true, ternary gives a.

    ~ When sspace plays.

    ~ If sfalse is truthy.

    ~ Not sfalse gives false, and gives true, or gives true, ternary gives a.

    ~ When sfalse plays.

    ~ If yes is truthy.

    ~ Not yes gives false, and gives true, or gives true, ternary gives a.

