    ~ If ref is truthy.

    ~ Not ref gives false, and gives true, or gives true, ternary gives a.

    ~ When ref plays.

    ~ If bob is truthy.

    ~ Not bob gives false, and gives true, or gives true, ternary gives a.

    ~ When bob plays.

    - Option n0
    + Option n1
    + Option nm2
    + Option h
    + Option s0
    - Option sempty
    + Option sspace
    + Option sfalse
    + Option yes
    - Option no
    - Option nothing
    - Option arr0
    + Option arr5
    + Option obj
    + Option ref
    + Option bob

    ~ Picked bob.

    ~ Done.
</test>
